 - Tesshô Genda\n- Koichi Kitamura\n- 渕崎ゆり子\n- Masaaki Okura\n- 
 Takeshi Kusao\n- Kazuhiro Kamifuji\n- Tatsuhiko Nakamura\n\n\nTetsuo\, un 
